Riverdale star Ryan Grantham has been  sentenced to life in prison for killing  his mother according to multiple reports  the 24 year old actor was reportedly  sentenced at British Columbia Supreme  Court in Vancouver on Wednesday reports  state that he will not be eligible for  parole for 14 years he told the police  he did it  to protect me but it wasn't him Grantham  started acting when he was six years old  his last gig an appearance on Riverdale  so sorry he's also recognized for his  role in the 2010 family comedy Diary of  a Wimpy Kid  [Music]  Grantham previously pleaded guilty to  second-degree murder after shooting his  64 year old mother Barbara wait in the  back of the head while she was playing  piano in March 2020. new details  surfaced during a hearing in June when  prosecutors claimed the actor confessed  to the crime on video which was shown in  court prosecutors also accused Grantham  of plotting to kill Canadian Prime  Minister Justin Trudeau alleging that he  packed his car with three guns  ammunition 12 Molotov cocktails camping  supplies and a map with directions to  Rodeo Cottage in Ottawa where the  politician lives prosecutors claimed  Grantham started the 50-hour drive to  Ottawa with the intention of killing  Trudeau but changed his mind and turned  around alleging that he contemplated  committing an act of violence at Simon  Frazier University where he had been a  student according to the BB see Grantham  ultimately decided to drive to a  Vancouver Police Station where he  allegedly confessed to an officer quote  I killed my mother he's extremely  remorseful for his actions and  he's doing everything he possibly can to  make amends for them law enforcement  officials in Vancouver explained to  deadline that Grantham has been in  custody since 2020 with sources adding  that he's been participating in mental  health programs since his arrest during  the third and final day of his June  hearing Grantham reportedly said quote  it hurts me to think about how badly  I've wasted my life in the face of  something so horrible saying sorry seems  so pointless but from every fiber of my  being I am sorry  foreign
 

